{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂1の乃木坂ヲタク\nかりんの発音 上り坂↑\n伊藤かりん↑です(っｴ`o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/08/17/9438744/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バタバタしていて、\n将棋フォーカスの夏期集中ドリルも\n将棋世界の宿題も\n全然終わっていなくて\n焦っています。(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"移動時間になんとかやるゾ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"--------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"広島ライブ楽しかったです♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"広島は親戚みたいなお世話になってる方が\n住んでるから何回か来たことがあって\n勝手に思い入れあります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お好み焼きすごい好きなのー！\n今回食べたいろんなところのお好み焼きも\nすごくすごく美味しかった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個人的にオススメは\nみっちゃんのお好み焼き！\n麺がパリパリなの(｡･ω･｡)  ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前に広島来た時の写真！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/08/17/9438744/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/08/17/9438744/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早いものでツアーも折り返し！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"福岡→大阪→神宮は\n日程がかなり怒涛なので\nみんなの体調や喉が心配ですが、\n楽しんで乗り切りたいと思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NOGIBINGOご覧いただき\nありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"七瀬さんとのトモダチャンス！\n頑張りましたが最終問題で\n痛恨のニアミス...(;_;)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"収録終了後、私の来た迷彩の服をみて\nこれも正解でいいのにね(;_;)と\n言ってくれたり、\n私の腕を掴んでくれたり、\nやっぱり七瀬さん可愛い...！と\n更に大好きになりました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/08/17/9438744/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"膝こっつんこ恥ずかしかったなあ///(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問返し"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/08/17/9438744/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/08/17/9438744/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブ中のＶＴＲって、\n映画用にとってたやつ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あれほんとだれのＶも素敵だよね(。´Д⊂)\nあれまとめて、映像化してほしいＯ(≧∇≦)Ｏ\nそれくらいの価値あるよね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何用に撮ったのかは分からないけど、\n映画っぽく生い立ち的なことも聞かれたし\nライブ用っぽくそういう質問もされた！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にいい映像(;_;)♡\nライブでの私達の躍動してる姿と\n合わせてこの映像を見てもらうと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この子はこんなことを考えながら\n頑張ってるんだなあって\nまた違う視点でライブ楽しめます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/08/17/9438744/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"告知"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/08/17/9438744/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-- TV --"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph"